- "“No thank you, I don’t want to go to Costco. I just went to Costco on Wednesday.”" [ar064-0002]
- "On the other hand, BROWN she remembered after the first time we named it and never gets it wrong lol" [ar072-0078]

**But:** An impressive skill coexists with age-typical needs: "I agree with him not receiving grace, mostly by older kids because he’s acting like them verbally, but social/emotionally, still very much a toddler" [ar064-0006]

